---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
// TODO(firm): review this statement and set the date you adopt it.
---
<Base title="Accessibility Statement">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Accessibility Statement" lede="Scaffidi Brunner is committed to a website that everyone can use, including people who rely on assistive technology." compact />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2 class="h-card">Our standard</h2>
      <p>This website is designed to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, Level AA. Accessibility is built into the site itself rather than added through an overlay or plug-in.</p>

      <h2 class="h-card">What that means in practice</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Every page and every interactive feature can be used with a keyboard alone, with a visible focus indicator.</li>
        <li>Text and controls meet AA color contrast in both the light and dark themes.</li>
        <li>Pages use meaningful headings, labels, and landmarks so screen readers can navigate them.</li>
        <li>Animation is reduced or removed when your device asks for reduced motion.</li>
        <li>Pages reflow to narrow screens and zoom without losing content.</li>
        <li>Every release is checked with automated accessibility testing (axe) on every page, in both themes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h-card">Known limitations</h2>
      <p>Our privacy policy, cookie policy, terms, and privacy-choices tools are provided by our compliance vendor, iubenda. We do not control their markup, though we monitor it and report problems to the vendor.</p>

      <h2 class="h-card">Tell us about a barrier</h2>
      <p>If anything on this site is difficult to use, please let us know and we will work with you to provide the information in another way. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}?subject=Accessibility`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or call <a href={site.contact.phoneHref}>{site.contact.phone}</a>, {site.contact.hours}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .prose h2:not(:first-child) { margin-top: 24px; }
  .prose ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent-text); }
</style>
